262: /**
263:  * Free a booking's tables. Deleting occupancy rows and marking the booking cancelled
264:  * happen in one transaction, so a cancelled booking is never half-freed and a confirmed
265:  * one never has its tables back. Deleting an unknown or already-cancelled booking is a
